## Dynamic configuration shapes

Event definitions use several Dynamic attributes. Available type catalogs:

```terraform
data "graylog_event_entity_types" "available" {}
```

| Attribute | Shape notes |
|---|---|
| `config` | Must include `type` (e.g. `aggregation-v1`, `system-notifications-v1`). Aggregation configs add query/series/conditions fields. |
| `field_spec` | Map of field name → provider object (`template-v1`, `lookup-v1`, …). |
| `notifications` | List of `{ notification_id = "..." }` (optional parameters). |
| `storage` | List of handlers; common: `{ type = "persist-to-streams-v1", streams = ["..."] }`. |
| `notification_settings` | Typed object: `grace_period_ms`, `backlog_size`. |

